::download_for_restore` snapshots the bound-device notification list. A later `bind_device` could add another device before the old receipt was confirmed, allowing confirmation to clear the pending state without notifying that device.\n\n## Solution\n- Make `bind_device` return `Result` and refuse new devices while restore notifications are pending.\n- Keep re-binding an already-listed device idempotent.\n- Add a regression for refusal, preserved pending state, confirmation, and subsequent ordered delivery to both devices.\n\n## Verification\n- `rustfmt --edition 2024 --check pkgs/id/src/backup.rs` — passed\n- `git diff --check` — passed\n- Focused `backup::tests::binding_device_is_refused_until_restore_notifications_are_confirmed` cargo test — running under `fleet-build-lock`; result to follow.\n\n<!-- codesmith:footer -->\n---\n<a href=\"https://backend.blacksmith.sh/track/enable-autofix?expires=1797107976&installation_model_id=443529&pr_number=9020&ref=codesmith_pr_footer&repository=developing-today%2Fcode&return_to=https%3A%2F%2Fgithub.com%2Fdeveloping-today%2Fcode%2Fpull%2F9020&signature=a5e55c6e7dfd67275c6a2655974ce84cdf07a3dd9677aadb70e0c6cac7d39858\"><picture><source media=\"(prefers-color-scheme: dark)\" srcset=\"https://pr-comments-assets.blacksmith.sh/codesmith/autofix-with-codesmith-dark.svg\"><source media=\"(prefers-color-scheme: light)\" srcset=\"https://pr-comments-assets.blacksmith.sh/codesmith/autofix-with-codesmith-light.svg\"><img alt=\"Autofix with [code]smith\" src=\"https://pr-comments-assets.blacksmith.sh/codesmith/autofix-with-codesmith-dark-3x.png\" width=\"190\" height=\"28\"></picture></a>\n<sup><a href=\"https://app.blacksmith.sh/developing-today/codesmith/code/pr/9020?autoLogin=true&ref=codesmith_pr_footer\">Open in [code]smith</a> · Need help on this PR? Tag <code>@codesmith-bot</code> with what you need.</sup>\n\n<!-- codesmith:autofix:disabled -->\n<!-- /codesmith:footer -->","labels":[{"id":13198400136,"node_id":"LA_kwDOJWP4788AAAAD